menu "DShot passthrough example"
    config EXAMPLE_DSHOT_GPIO
        int "ESC signal GPIO"
        range -1 21 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32C3
        range -1 48 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
        default 0 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32C3
        default 4 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
        help
            The single signal wire used by DShot and ESC passthrough.
            -1 disables the example. Regular DShot300 at 1000 frames/s is fixed
            by the example; there is no signaling or bitrate selection here.
endmenu
